    excerpt: "Life can take unexpected turns. For me, those turns spiraled into an abyss of addiction, pain, and regret. My name is Anil Sharma, and this is the story of how Rahul Seth helped me conquer my addiction.",
    date: "May 25, 2024",
    readTime: "3 min read",
